# ==============================================================================
# Security Hardening & Edge Response Headers for asedapraise.com
# 
# NOTE ON DEPLOYMENT:
# - Cloudflare Pages: Automatically parses and applies this _headers file.
# - Cloudflare Proxied Custom Domain (GitHub Pages behind Cloudflare):
#   Apply these same headers using Cloudflare Transform Rules -> Modify Response Header
#   or Cloudflare Workers for edge response header injection.
# ==============================================================================

/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains; preload
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self'; style-src 'self' https://fonts.googleapis.com; font-src 'self' https://fonts.gstatic.com; img-src 'self' https://img.youtube.com data:; frame-src https://www.youtube.com https://www.youtube-nocookie.com; connect-src 'self'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; frame-ancestors 'self'; form-action 'self'; upgrade-insecure-requests;
